# ~/.config doubles as this repo's working tree, so it holds app caches,
# session cookies and credential stores right next to the dotfiles we
# actually version. Ignore everything, then opt directories back in.
#
# To start tracking a new config: add a `!/<dir>/` line below.

/*
!/.gitignore

!/awesome/
!/kitty/
!/macos/
!/nvim/

# --- keep these out of the whitelisted directories ----------------------
/awesome/.pi-subagents/
/awesome/.claude/
# your own tools, merged by `brew bundle` but not part of the setup
/macos/Brewfile.local

# --- candidates: uncomment to start tracking ---------------------------
# !/autostart/
# !/btop/
# !/fastfetch/
# !/lazygit/
# !/mc/
# !/picom/
# !/qalculate/
# !/ranger/
# !/rofi/
# !/systemd/
# !/xmbwave/

# --- never add a `!/` rule for these -----------------------------------
# Already covered by `/*`. Listed so nobody whitelists them by reflex:
#
#   gcloud/                    cached OAuth credentials
#   asymmetric-key-generator/  private key material
#   Postman/                   saved API keys
#   Vencord/  legcord/         Discord client tokens
#   opencode/  opencode-multi-auth/  coding-agent API keys
#   zen/  chromium/  google-chrome/  opera/  torbrowser/   session cookies
#   Cursor/  cursor/           editor state and cookies
#   discord/                   session tokens
#   spicetify/                 Spotify auth
